#strong[Holdout at `q = 7`] (predictions frozen in Amendment 2):

- #strong[P-a passed.] All 19 traces with `D ≥ 0.0143` have hits. But the agent leaned "no" on the no-claim trace `t = 93`, and it was hit. A threshold rule on `D` is not supported.
- #strong[P-b passed], at 0.636 and 0.217.
- #strong[P-c failed.] The total mass is 1552, outside the predicted \[490, 1100\]; the forecast was a two-point `q^3.4` extrapolation.

